#. 葉隠クンの殴打のせいで大神さんが死んだなら、
#. 彼女の<CLT 3>頭の傷が２つだった事<CLT>の説明が付かないよ…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If Sakura died from Hiro's single blow, that doesn't\n"
"explain why she had <CLT 3>two head wounds<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. え…？　２つ…？
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? Two...?"
msgstr ""

#. そう…彼女の頭部の傷は２つだったのよ。
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's right. She had two separate wounds on her head."
msgstr ""

#. 死体を触るのが趣味の女が言うんだ。
#. 間違いないんだろう…
msgctxt "0004 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And remember, this girl examines dead bodies as a\n"
"hobby. Personally, I'm inclined to believe her."
msgstr ""

#. でも、俺が殴ったのは<CLT 3>１回<CLT>なのに…
#. どうして頭の傷が<CLT 3>２つ<CLT>あるんだ…？
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But...I only hit her <CLT 3>once<CLT>. How could she have <CLT 3>two<CLT>\n"
"wounds?"
msgstr ""

#. 実は、<CLT 3>殴打が２回あった<CLT>って事よ。
#. しかも、モノクマボトルによる殴打がね。
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Two wounds means she was <CLT 3>struck twice<CLT>. What's more,\n"
"both attacks must have come from a Monokuma Bottle."
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと待ちなさいよ…！
#. あ、頭の傷だけで…どうしてそこまでわかるの…？
msgctxt "0007 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"H-Hold on! How can you know that j-just from some cuts\n"
"on her head?"
msgstr ""

#. 殴打が２回もあったなんて…
#. それも、モノクマボトルによる殴打なんて…
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "She was a-attacked twice! With two M-Monokuma Bottles!"
msgstr ""

#. 手掛かりは、頭の傷だけじゃない…
#. 現場に残されたモノクマボトルにもあったわ。
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's not just because of her head wounds. It's also\n"
"because of the Monokuma Bottles themselves."
msgstr ""

#. あのモノクマボトルには、
#. 明らかに<CLT 3>不審な点<CLT>があった…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's something <CLT 3>very suspicious<CLT> about those\n"
"bottles..."
msgstr ""

#. その不審な点をハッキリさせる事で、
#. モノクマボトルでの殴打が、２回あったとわかるのよ。
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Once you understand that point, you'll understand why\n"
"two separate Monokuma Bottles must have been used."
msgstr ""

#. 思い出してみて…事件後の娯楽室の棚には、
#. <CLT 3>４本のモノクマボトル<CLT>が残されていたでしょう…？
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Think back...after the incident, there were <CLT 3>4\n"
"Monokuma Bottles<CLT> left on the shelf, right?"
msgstr ""

#. それと、床には１本分の破片と
#. モノクマフィギュアが落ちていたわね…
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And we found pieces of a bottle on the ground, along\n"
"with the chess piece it had inside."
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クンが大神さんを殴打した時に
#. 割ったボトルだよね？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That was the bottle Hiro hit Sakura with, right?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、あの現場には４本のモノクマボトルと、
#. １本分の破片があった事になるけど…
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"For now, just note that there were four intact\n"
"bottles, and one broken bottle."
msgstr ""

#. でも、モノクマボトルは全部で<CLT 3>６本<CLT>のはず。
#. １本足りないのよ…
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But originally, there were <CLT 3>six<CLT> bottles in total.\n"
"Meaning one has gone missing."
msgstr ""

#. どうして…モノクマボトルが全部で６本だって…
#. わ、わかるのよ…？
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"But h-how can you know for sure there were s-six\n"
"bottles...?"
msgstr ""

#. 簡単よ…
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's easy."
msgstr ""

#. あのモノクマボトルに隠された<CLT 3>規則性<CLT>を見れば、
#. すぐにわかるじゃない。
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you look at what the bottles <CLT 3>all had in common<CLT>,\n"
"it should become clear."
msgstr ""
